  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDRN Project closure and exit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2008, CDRN has equipped  local community members especially community based monitors and management committee members with  knowledge and skills in relation to local development planning process and how to monitor service delivery. CDRN  is also a  resource partner to Uganda Justice and Peace partners whose core areas of function in  partnership with NCCJP  include; Support NCCJP, Northern Dioceses Gulu, Moroto and Kotido   organisational capacity assessments, development of  capacity strengthening plans and implementing organizational development plans, developing and reviewing as advocacy strategies as change agents. 
 
This is a one year project phase out and partner exit grant to enable CDRN prepare community and partners to continue advocacy and organisational strengthening beyond CAFOD  financial support</narrative>
  </description>
